    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It sounds like the whole framework is basically designed to favor the big players while leaving everyone else with just talk. Do you think the push for \"global governance\" is actually just a way for these international bodies to slowly erode national sovereignty in favor of a more centralized, unelected authority?",
